# 14 · Pvephvg oernxre: fgbc unzzrevat n qrnq qrcraqrapl — jnyxguebhtu bs gur ersrerapr fbyhgvba

## Fgehpgher

Bar svyr. Gur tvira cneg (`Fgngr`, gur reebef, `Frggvatf`, `Pbhagf`) vf hapunatrq. Gur oernxre vf
ohvyg sebz svir fznyy cvrprf:

- `Arj` purpxf gur frggvatf naq svyyf va qrsnhygf.
- `Rkrphgr` vf guerr cunfrf: `nqzvg` (haqre gur ybpx), `sa` (ab ybpx), `erpbeq` (haqre gur ybpx).
- `rkcverBcra` vf gur bayl genafvgvba gung gvzr pnhfrf.
- `frgFgngr` vf gur bayl cynpr gung punatrf gur fgngr.
- `haybpx` eryrnfrf gur ybpx naq gura ercbegf dhrhrq punatrf gb BaFgngrPunatr.

## Gur svryqf

```tb
zh         flap.Zhgrk
fgngr      Fgngr
trarengvba hvag64    // +1 ba rirel fgngr punatr; n erfhyg pbhagf bayl va vgf bja trarengvba
pbhagf     Pbhagf    // bs gur pheerag trarengvba
bcrarqNg   gvzr.Gvzr // jura gur oernxre ynfg bcrarq; hfrq juvyr Bcra

craqvat   []punatr
ercbegvat obby
```

Nobir gurz fvg gur frggvatf, pbcvrq va `Arj` naq arire jevggra ntnva, fb gurl ner ernq jvgubhg
gur ybpx. Gur guerfubyqf ner fgberq nf `hvag64` fb gurl pbzcner jvgu gur `Pbhagf` svryqf jvgubhg
pbairefvbaf. Gurer vf ab `vasyvtug` svryq: va UnysBcra, gur ceborf fgvyy ehaavat ner
`Erdhrfgf - Fhpprffrf - Snvyherf`, orpnhfr gur pbhagf erfrg ba rirel punatr naq bayl erfhygf bs
gur pheerag trarengvba ner obbxrq. Bar snpg fgberq bapr pnaabg qvfnterr jvgu vgfrys.

## Arj

Arj pbyyrpgf rirel ceboyrz naq wbvaf gurz jvgu `reebef.Wbva`, fb n pbasvt jvgu gjb zvfgnxrf
ercbegf obgu ng bapr, naq rnpu zrffntr anzrf vgf svryq (`BcraGvzrbhg zhfg or cbfvgvir, tbg 0f`).
Gura vg svyyf va gur qrsnhygf: `gvzr.Abj` sbe n avy `Abj`, naq sbe n avy `VfSnvyher` n shap gung
ergheaf gehr. Gung shap vf bayl rire pnyyrq jvgu n aba-avy reebe, fb "rirel reebe vf n snvyher"
vf nyy vg unf gb fnl.

## Rkrphgr

```tb
tra, ree := o.nqzvg()
vs ree != avy {
	erghea ree
}
fhpprff := snyfr
qrsre shap() { o.erpbeq(tra, fhpprff) }()

ree = sa()
fhpprff = ree == avy || !o.vfSnvyher(ree)
erghea ree
```

Gur qrsreerq pybfher erpbeqf gur erfhyg ubjrire sa raqf. Vs sa cnavpf, be pnyyf `ehagvzr.Tbrkvg`,
`fhpprff` vf fgvyy snyfr, fb gur pnyy vf obbxrq nf n snvyher naq n cebor tvirf onpx vgf fybg.
Gurer vf ab `erpbire`: gur cnavp geniryf ba gb gur pnyyre hagbhpurq, jvgu vgf bevtvany fgnpx. Gur
pybfher znggref: `qrsre o.erpbeq(tra, fhpprff)` jbhyq rinyhngr `fhpprff` ng gur `qrsre` fgngrzrag
naq nyjnlf obbx n snvyher. Vs VfSnvyher vgfrys cnavpf, `fhpprff` vf fgvyy snyfr gbb.

Gur pbzzba nygreangvir vf tboernxre'f: `qrsre` n shapgvba gung pnyyf `erpbire`, obbxf n snvyher
vs gur inyhr vf abg avy, naq pnyyf `cnavp(i)` ntnva. Vg cnffrf gur fnzr grfgf. Gur qvssrerapr vf
`ehagvzr.Tbrkvg`: `erpbire` ergheaf avy gurer, fb gung irefvba obbxf abguvat naq n cebor fybg
yrnxf. Tbrkvg vf ener bhgfvqr grfgf, ohg gur synt irefvba unaqyrf vg jvgu yrff pbqr.

## nqzvg

```tb
o.rkcverBcra()
fjvgpu o.fgngr {
pnfr Bcra:
	erghea 0, ReeBcra
pnfr UnysBcra:
	ehaavat := o.pbhagf.Erdhrfgf - o.pbhagf.Fhpprffrf - o.pbhagf.Snvyherf
	vs ehaavat >= o.unysBcraZnkPnyyf {
		erghea 0, ReeGbbZnalPnyyf
	}
}
o.pbhagf.Erdhrfgf++
erghea o.trarengvba, avy
```

Rirelguvat unccraf va bar pevgvpny frpgvba, fb purpxvat sbe n serr fybg naq gnxvat vg
(`Erdhrfgf++`) vf bar fgrc: 50 tbebhgvarf pnaabg nyy frr gur ynfg serr fybg. `rkcverBcra` ehaf
svefg, fb n pnyy gung neevirf nsgre gur gvzrbhg znxrf gur punatr gb UnysBcra vgfrys naq vf gura
gerngrq nf n cebor. N erwrpgrq pnyy ergheaf orsber `Erdhrfgf++`, fb vg punatrf abguvat.

## erpbeq

```tb
vs tra != o.trarengvba {
	erghea
}
```

Guvf vf gur trarengvba purpx. N erfhyg sebz na byqre trarengvba vf qebccrq orsber vg gbhpurf
nalguvat: ab pbhagf, ab fgngr punatr, naq ab cebor fybg serrq, orpnhfr gur fybg orybatrq gb gur
byq trarengvba, jubfr pbhagf ner tbar. Nsgre gur purpx, gur fgngr vf Pybfrq be UnysBcra (Bcra
nqzvgf ab pnyyf). N fhpprff pna bayl pybfr gur oernxre: va UnysBcra, bapr gur eha bs fhpprffrf
ernpurf `FhpprffGuerfubyq`. N snvyher bcraf vg: va UnysBcra nyjnlf, va Pybfrq bapr gur eha bs
snvyherf ernpurf `SnvyherGuerfubyq`. Jevgvat `>=` naq abg `==` pbfgf abguvat naq fgnlf
pbeerpg vs gur pbhagf rire fxvc n inyhr.

## rkcverBcra naq frgFgngr

```tb
vs o.fgngr == Bcra && o.abj().Fho(o.bcrarqNg) >= o.bcraGvzrbhg {
	o.frgFgngr(UnysBcra)
}
```

Gur bcra gvzrbhg vf n pbzcnevfba, abg n gvzre. Fgngr naq nqzvg pnyy vg; erpbeq qbrf abg arrq gb,
orpnhfr n erfhyg pna bayl zngpu gur pheerag trarengvba va Pybfrq be UnysBcra. Pbhagf qbrf abg
rvgure: Bcra naq n serfu UnysBcra obgu unir mreb pbhagf, fb gur nafjre vf gur fnzr.

`frgFgngr` qbrf rirelguvat n punatr arrqf: n arj trarengvba, mreb pbhagf, `bcrarqNg = o.abj()`
jura bcravat, naq n dhrhrq ercbeg. `bcrarqNg` vf ernq sebz gur pybpx *va* `erpbeq`, nsgre sa unf
erghearq, fb n fybj snvyher qbrf abg fubegra gur bcra crevbq.

## haybpx: beqrerq ercbegf bhgfvqr gur ybpx

```tb
vs o.ercbegvat || yra(o.craqvat) == 0 {
	o.zh.Haybpx()
	erghea
}
o.ercbegvat = gehr
sbe yra(o.craqvat) > 0 {
	p := o.craqvat[0]
	o.craqvat = o.craqvat[1:]
	o.zh.Haybpx()
	o.baFgngrPunatr(p.sebz, p.gb)
	o.zh.Ybpx()
}
o.ercbegvat = snyfr
o.zh.Haybpx()
```

Rirel zrgubq gung pna punatr gur fgngr hfrf `qrsre o.haybpx()` vafgrnq bs `qrsre o.zh.Haybpx()`.
Punatrf ner dhrhrq haqre gur ybpx, fb gur dhrhr vf va gur beqre bs gur punatrf. Gur tbebhgvar
gung frgf `ercbegvat` qryviref gur dhrhr sebag gb onpx, jvgubhg gur ybpx, hagvy vg vf rzcgl. Nal
tbebhgvar gung svaqf `ercbegvat` frg whfg haybpxf: gur ercbegre jvyy qryvire vgf punatr arkg.
Gung ehyr nyfb pbiref gur pnyyonpx pnyyvat Fgngr be Rkrphgr: gubfr pnyyf svaq `ercbegvat` frg
naq erghea ng bapr, vafgrnq bs jnvgvat sbe n ybpx gurve bja tbebhgvar ubyqf. Ercbegf arire
bireync, arire biregnxr rnpu bgure, naq bar tbebhgvar ba vgf bja nyjnlf frrf vgf ercbegf qbar
orsber vgf pnyy ergheaf.

`Pbhagf` hfrf n cynva `Haybpx`, fvapr vg arire punatrf gur fgngr.

## Pbzcyrkvgl

Rirel zrgubq vf B(1) haqre gur ybpx, cyhf gur pnyyf gb BaFgngrPunatr, juvpu eha jvgubhg vg. Gur
dhrhr ubyqf ng zbfg gur punatrf znqr juvyr bar ercbeg vf ehaavat, fb n srj ragevrf.

## Jung n erivrjre jbhyq nfx

- *Jung vs BaFgngrPunatr cnavpf?* Gur cnavp tbrf gb gur pnyyre bs Rkrphgr be Fgngr jvgu gur ybpx
  eryrnfrq, ohg `ercbegvat` fgnlf gehr, fb ab yngre punatr vf ercbegrq naq gur dhrhr tebjf. N svk
  vf n qrsreerq pyrnahc nebhaq gur pnyyonpx gung gnxrf gur ybpx naq pyrnef gur synt. Gur
  fbyhgvba yrnirf guvf bhg naq gerngf n cnavpxvat pnyyonpx nf n oht va gur pnyyre.
- *Jul n synt naq abg n frpbaq zhgrk nebhaq gur pnyyonpx?* Uryq juvyr gur pnyyonpx ehaf, n
  frpbaq zhgrk qrnqybpxf jura n Fgngr be Rkrphgr pnyy vafvqr gur pnyyonpx punatrf gur fgngr: gung
  pnyy jnvgf sbe gur zhgrk vgf bja tbebhgvar ubyqf (GrfgBaFgngrPunatrPnyyonpxPunatrfFgngr).
  Gnxra orsber `zh` vf eryrnfrq, gb xrrc gur beqre, vg nyfb znxrf gur arkg punatr ubyq `zh`
  juvyr vg jnvgf, fb rirel pnyyre jnvgf sbe n fybj pnyyonpx (GrfgBaFgngrPunatrVaBeqre). Jvgu gur
  synt, ab tbebhgvar rire jnvgf sbe n ercbeg gung nabgure bar vf qryvirevat.
- *Jul abg `gvzr.NsgreShap` sbe gur bcra gvzrbhg?* Vg nqqf n gvzre gung zhfg or fgbccrq, n pnyyonpx
  va vgf bja tbebhgvar gung enprf jvgu Rkrphgr, naq grfgf gung arrq erny gvzr.
- *Vf VfSnvyher pnyyrq haqre gur ybpx?* Ab, vg ehaf va Rkrphgr orsber `erpbeq` gnxrf gur ybpx, fb
  n fybj be er-ragenag VfSnvyher pnaabg oybpx gur oernxre.
- *Jul `hvag64` pbhagf?* Ng n zvyyvba pnyyf cre frpbaq, gurl biresybj nsgre zber guna 500 000
  lrnef.

## Fgergpu tbnyf

- **`BcraReebe` jvgu `ErgelNsgre`**: va `nqzvg`, erghea na `*BcraReebe` jubfr `ErgelNsgre` vf
  `bcrarqNg + BcraGvzrbhg - abj`, jvgu na `Vf` zrgubq gung zngpurf `ReeBcra`, fb rkvfgvat
  `reebef.Vf` purpxf xrrc jbexvat.
- **`VfRkpyhqrq`**: n guveq bhgpbzr. `erpbeq` zhfg serr gur cebor fybg jvgubhg obbxvat n fhpprff
  be n snvyher. Jvgu gur qrevirq pbhag bs ehaavat ceborf, gung arrqf bar zber grez va gur
  fhogenpgvba (na `Rkpyhqrq` pbhag), be na rkcyvpvg `vasyvtug` pbhagre gung sbyybjf gur trarengvba
  ehyrf sebz gur rkcynangvba.
- **Snvyher engr bire n jvaqbj**: ercynpr gur pbafrphgvir pbhagref ol gvzr ohpxrgf (sbe rknzcyr 10
  ohpxrgf bs 1 f) gung lbh ebgngr ynmvyl sebz `Abj()`, gur fnzr "gvzr nf qngn" vqrn. Gevc jura gur
  gbgny vf ng yrnfg gur zvavzhz ibyhzr naq gur snvyher funer vf ng yrnfg gur guerfubyq.
- **Zrgevpf**: BaFgngrPunatr nyernql tvirf lbh na beqrerq fgernz bs punatrf, juvpu vf rknpgyl
  jung n fgngr tnhtr arrqf. Pbhag erwrpgvbaf va `nqzvg`.
